## Chart table

@ilo{code="0010"}: The long hall has a keeper. Had. An eel as long as this ship.
@sefa{code="0010" emotion="surprised"}: Had?
@ilo{code="0020"}: It went out a window.
@sefa{code="0020" emotion="delighted"}: Then the long hall is clear! Hold still, I need the length of it in paces.
::assert{told(sefa, eel)}
::set{user.bond.sefa += 1}
